---
// New board (2026-11-10 rule): separate from the pre-launch (old) board, never ranked together.
// Data: src/data/axes-new.json, generated by tools/amberdb/sync_site.py from amber.db (lanes.board='new').
// Scores come from the data file; only the per-lane notes below are text.
import newLanes from '../data/axes-new.json';

interface Props { lang?: 'zh' | 'en' }
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';

const held = (lane) => Object.values(lane.axis).reduce((s, c) => s + (c.na ?? 0), 0);
const score = (lane) => `${lane.total}${held(lane) > 0 ? '′' : ''}/${lane.n}`;
const page = (lane) => `https://github.com/getaskclaw/${lane.repo}/blob/main/results/2026-${lane.wk}${zh ? '' : '.en'}.md`;

const NOTE = zh
  ? '无场次编号（sitting code），来源证据为 launch 账本'
  : 'No sitting code; source evidence is the launch ledger';
const EXTRA = {
  'nb-gpt6-sol': zh
    ? 'A-3f2a9cdd（收敛案）经转录适配器修复（main 67d8bf34）后离线重判，合成口径'
    : 'A-3f2a9cdd (convergence case) re-judged offline after the transcript-adapter fix (main 67d8bf34); synthesized basis',
};
---
<section class="section new-board" id="new-board" aria-labelledby="new-board-title">
  <h2 id="new-board-title">{zh ? '新榜' : 'New board'}</h2>
  {zh ? (
    <p class="nb-lead">新榜只收 2026-11-10 上线后的场次，与下方旧榜（上线前成绩）分开，不合并排名。共 {newLanes[0]?.n ?? 24} 案；总分带 ′ 表示有挂起题（不计胜负）。</p>
  ) : (
    <p class="nb-lead">The new board takes only sittings after the 2026-11-10 launch. It is kept apart from the old board (pre-launch results) below and is not ranked together with it. {newLanes[0]?.n ?? 24} cases; a ′ on a total marks held cases (neither win nor loss).</p>
  )}
  <p class="nb-hint">{zh
    ? '一次性例外：以下五道（2026-11-12 考）没有场次编号，经 owner 2026-11-13 批准按 launch 账本证据进新榜；新榜收录规则原文不变，不构成先例。'
    : 'One-time exception: the five lanes below (sat 2026-11-12) carry no sitting code and were admitted to the new board on the launch-ledger evidence by owner approval of 2026-11-13; the new-board rule itself is unchanged and this is not a precedent.'}</p>
  <div class="nb-scroll">
    <table class="nb-table">
      <thead><tr>
        <th scope="col">{zh ? '模型' : 'Model'}</th>
        <th scope="col">{zh ? '档位' : 'Effort'}</th>
        <th scope="col">{zh ? '成绩' : 'Score'}</th>
        <th scope="col">{zh ? '周' : 'Week'}</th>
        <th scope="col">{zh ? '注记' : 'Notes'}</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {newLanes.map((lane) => (
          <tr data-lane={lane.id}>
            <th scope="row"><a href={page(lane)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{lane.name}</a></th>
            <td>high</td>
            <td class="nb-score">{score(lane)}</td>
            <td>{lane.wk}</td>
            <td class="nb-note">{NOTE}{EXTRA[lane.id] ? (zh ? '；' : '; ') + EXTRA[lane.id] : ''}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .new-board .nb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .new-board .nb-lead { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
  .new-board .nb-hint { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4a5560; margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem; }
  .new-board .nb-table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .new-board .nb-table th, .new-board .nb-table td { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .new-board .nb-score { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
  .new-board .nb-note { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #4a5560; }
</style>
